{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_116_werewolf_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n正在全身心地唱着歌。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_117_thief_ev_talk.txt/0": "什、什么鬼……？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_117_thief_ev_talk.txt/1": "这么说着，<TARGET>\r\n却满脸通红！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_118_minotaur_ev_talk.txt/0": "我很厉害！\r\n怎么样，看我这副身体！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_118_minotaur_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>摆出姿势，\r\n得意地炫耀着肌肉。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_dead.txt/0": "好痛啊啊……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_dead.txt/1": "救、救命……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_dead.txt/2": "咕呃……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/0": "别耍花样！我杀了你！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/1": "哎呀呀，看看这家伙！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/2": "啧！原来是个男人……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/3": "是个女人……嘿嘿！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/4": "然后要扒光你的所有东西吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/5": "杀了你……全部抢走！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/6": "嘿嘿嘿。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/7": "要动手吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/8": "男人全都得死！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_find.txt/9": "就先从你杀起吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_talk.txt/0": "什、什么鬼……？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_119_bandit_ev_talk.txt/1": "“你是我的猎物！”\r\n<TARGET>嘴上这样说着，\r\n脸却已经涨得通红。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "啊，是你……\r\n呃，路上小心，\r\n回头再见？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "祝你一路平安！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "唔，看来我确实应该\r\n随身带着地图……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "哦，你也在旅行吗？\r\n我是从东方来的旅人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/4": "咦？什么……你被盗贼\r\n抢光了所有东西？\r\n可你看起来倒是一点也不害臊……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/5": "没关系！\r\n这就是我的风格！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/6": "真、真的吗？好吧，我会尽量\r\n不把这件事放在心上……\r\n我是从东方来的旅人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/7": "哇啊啊？！\r\n咦，僵尸？还会说话？\r\n你不会吃我吧？好……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/8": "其实你也没那么奇怪。\r\n如果你愿意，我可以告诉你\r\n我发现的地牢在哪里，但别咬我哦？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/9": "那、那么回头见。\r\n旅行途中确实会遇见\r\n各种各样的……人……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/10": "对了，你该不会是……\r\n一位身份高贵的人吧？\r\n如果冒犯了，真是抱歉。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/11": "如果你不介意，我可以告诉你\r\n我发现的地牢在哪里。\r\n希望它对你的旅途有所帮助。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/12": "那么，\r\n祝你一路平安！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/13": "不知为何，我一踏上旅途，\r\n就总是会遇见\r\n各种各样的地牢……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/14": "这次也总算找到了\r\n一座城镇……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/15": "同为旅人，就让我告诉你\r\n我发现的地牢\r\n在哪里吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_11_dangeon_man_ev_talk.txt/16": "那么，回头见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_120_fire_goblin_ev_talk.txt/0": "哥布，哥布！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_120_fire_goblin_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>仿佛在说“再鼓足干劲”，\r\n将力量注入通红的身躯。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_121_wraith_knight_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘎，嘎叽叽叽叽叽……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_121_wraith_knight_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>的披风\r\n在风中飘扬。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_122_minotaur_heavily_armed_ev_talk.txt/0": "哞，哞呜呜呜！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_122_minotaur_heavily_armed_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>似乎说了些什么，\r\n但完全听不懂……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_123_dragon_ev_find.txt/0": "嘎嗷嗷嗷——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_123_dragon_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘎嗷嗷嗷嗷——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_123_dragon_ev_talk.txt/1": "开心的<TARGET>正\r\n向四面八方喷吐火焰。\r\n啊，好烫！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_124_killer_wolf_ev_talk.txt/0": "你的背后由我来守护！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_124_killer_wolf_ev_talk.txt/1": "说完这句话，<TARGET>\r\n似乎为了掩饰害羞，\r\n故意摆出了一副帅气的样子。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_125_snow_bear_ev_talk.txt/0": "嗷嗷嗷！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_125_snow_bear_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>开心地\r\n追着\\c[51]梅莫莉娅\\c[0]玩耍。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_127_golem_ev_find.txt/0": "咕嗷嗷嗷……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_127_golem_ev_talk.txt/0": "（咚咣——！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_127_golem_ev_talk.txt/1": "你回头时撞上了\r\n<TARGET>。好痛……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_128_killer_hound_ev_talk.txt/0": "呜——呜——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_128_killer_hound_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>端正地坐下，\r\n开心地抬头望着这边。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_12_spry_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "求求你……\r\n请不要吃我……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_12_spry_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "勇者……求求你……\r\n救救我。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_12_spry_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "呜，光、光要来了……\r\n救救我……光……咦！？\r\n呀，呀啊啊啊啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_12_spry_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "救命！别吃我！\r\n这、这个给你！\r\n求你救救我……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_12_spry_man_ev_talk.txt/4": "呜，求求你们……谁来救救我……\r\n光要……咦？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_12_spry_man_ev_talk.txt/5": "你难道是……？！……勇者！\r\n求你拯救这个世界吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_12_spry_man_ev_talk.txt/6": "不知道这东西能不能派上用场……\r\n不过请带着它吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_12_spry_man_ev_talk.txt/7": "拜托……拜托了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_130_darkness_ev_find.txt/0": "\\>光之巨人正在积蓄能量。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_134_pet_ev_find.txt/0": "呜噜噜……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_darkness.txt/0": "怎么会……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/0": "哈哈哈哈哈！\r\n我有一项特技！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/1": "只要看一眼，\r\n我就能测出那个人的魅力！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/2": "而你是……啊啊啊啊啊啊，\r\n怪物！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/3": "别……\r\n别靠近我！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/4": "咦，女、女王陛下！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/5": "以我这样卑微的身份，\r\n竟想测量陛下您的\r\n魅力……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/6": "这世上根本不可能有人\r\n拥有超越您的\r\n魅力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/7": "女王陛下！求求您……求求您\r\n带我一起踏上旅途……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/8": "我发誓一定会为您效力！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/9": "至于您……\r\n什、什么！\r\n负魅力？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/10": "离我远点！\r\n……抱歉，您的魅力实在太低，\r\n让我一时失态了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/11": "你恐怕很难在旅途中\r\n找到同伴，不过，\r\n算了，尽力而为吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/12": "您是……\r\n魅力等级只有\\c[53]0\\c[0]？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/13": "我实在没有跟您走的理由。\r\n您实在太过普通了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/14": "不过，您也未必完全无可救药。\r\n努力提升魅力，\r\n看看能做到什么程度吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/15": "您是……\r\n魅力等级为\\c[53]1\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/16": "看来还算值得信赖。\r\n应该会有一些人愿意\r\n信任并追随您。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/17": "不过，还不足以让\r\n众多同伴对您寄予\r\n深厚的信赖。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/18": "听说有些职业在升级时\r\n会提升魅力。\r\n总之，可不要松懈努力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/19": "您是……\r\n哦！魅力等级为\\c[53]2\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/20": "您看起来非常值得信赖。\r\n很少有人拥有这么高的\r\n魅力。真是了不起。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/21": "除非对方极其讨厌与人相处，\r\n普通人大多会愿意\r\n与您一同踏上旅途。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/22": "哇？！您的魅力等级是……\r\n竟然是\\c[53]3\\c[0]！？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/23": "有这样的魅力，无论什么人都\r\n会愿意成为您的同伴吧。\r\n……连我都差点动心了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/24": "但请务必注意。\r\n使用魅力时，\r\n它会随着消耗而降低。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/25": "您是……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/26": "什？！哇啊啊啊啊啊啊\r\n啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊\r\n啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/27": "这魅力实在太惊人了！！\r\n竟、竟然已经无法测量……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/28": "请、请问您愿意\r\n让我也加入您的旅途吗……？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/29": "这名士兵的能力只是普通？\r\n不过带上他应该也\r\n不会有什么麻烦……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/30": "要邀请他加入吗？\r\n\\c[52][需要魅力等级 $tmp3]\\c[0]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/31": "怎……怎么会……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/32": "魅力不足……\r\n看来对方并不怎么信任你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/33": "请交给我吧！\r\n直到死为止，\r\n我都不会离开您身边！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/34": "康拉斯士兵D加入了队伍！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/0": "呜哇，怪物啊！\r\n就算是“黑暗公会”，\r\n也不会接纳怪物吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/1": "……不对，只要有\r\n“特殊资格”，\r\n就算是怪物也没关系吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/2": "嘿嘿！你……听说过吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/3": "听说某处有叫做\r\n“黑暗公会”“骑士堡垒”\r\n以及“罪人之城”的地方。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/4": "据说没有“特殊资格”，\r\n就无法进入那些地方。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/5": "黑暗公会似乎需要\r\n执照卡，但……\r\n另外两处又要什么条件呢……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/6": "啧……原来如此……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/320": "什么？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_13_sailor_ev_talk.txt/346": "当然。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_14_old_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "哦，你就是勇者啊。\r\n我没什么能帮上你的，\r\n不过可以告诉你去下一座城镇有多远……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_14_old_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "……话虽如此，从这里往东，\r\n城镇确实不太多。\r\n不过还是节省些，继续前进吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_14_old_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "让我想想……\r\n再前进\\c[52]$tmp1km\\c[0]，\r\n就能到达下一座城镇。祝你旅途顺利。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_155_learn_force_aryan_ev_find.txt/0": "你需要魔法吗……？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_155_learn_force_aryan_ev_talk.txt/0": "我有些累了……\r\n对不起，勇者。\r\n我一次只能传授你一项能力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_155_learn_force_aryan_ev_talk.txt/1": "若我们还能再见，\r\n到时我可以再教你一些。\r\n在那之前，请好好运用这份力量。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_155_learn_force_aryan_ev_talk.txt/2": "竟在我面前展露无遗……\r\n我的目光实在忍不住四处游移。\r\n可你却毫不畏缩，真是大胆！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/3530": "邀请加入。（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/3602": "\\c[4]邀请加入。（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]_$tmp2Insuff.\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_137_soldier_ev_talk.txt/3685": "恶心！别靠近我！"
}
